# Local-only secrets and overrides for `npx wrangler dev --local`.
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and replace every placeholder before testing
# session creation. Do not commit `.dev.vars`.
#
# EVENT_SIGNING_SECRET="replace-with-a-long-random-local-secret"
# IP_HASH_SECRET="replace-with-a-different-long-random-local-secret"
# ADMIN_USERNAME="replace-with-a-local-administrator-username"
# ADMIN_PASSWORD="replace-with-a-long-unique-local-administrator-password"
# ADMIN_SESSION_SIGNING_SECRET="replace-with-a-third-long-random-local-secret"
#
# Origin overrides. Production serves only the ALLOWED_ORIGIN set in
# wrangler.jsonc and intentionally rejects localhost, so these two exist for
# local development and must never be added to wrangler.jsonc.
# LOCAL_ALLOWED_ORIGIN accepts one extra origin; EXTRA_ALLOWED_ORIGINS accepts a
# comma-separated list. Both are added to, never replace, ALLOWED_ORIGIN.
# ALLOWED_ORIGIN="http://127.0.0.1:8000"
# LOCAL_ALLOWED_ORIGIN="http://127.0.0.1:8000"
# EXTRA_ALLOWED_ORIGINS="http://127.0.0.1:8011,http://localhost:8000"
